#. module: account_fix_storno_negative
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:account_fix_storno_negative.field_account_fix_storno_wizard__line_count
msgid "Lines to Fix"
msgstr "Líneas a corregir"

#. module: account_fix_storno_negative
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:account_fix_storno_negative.field_account_fix_storno_wizard__move_count
msgid "Entries to Fix"
msgstr "Asientos a corregir"

#. module: account_fix_storno_negative
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:account_fix_storno_negative.field_account_fix_storno_wizard__move_ids
msgid "Selected Entries"
msgstr "Asientos seleccionados"

#. module: account_fix_storno_negative
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:account_fix_storno_negative.field_account_fix_storno_wizard__skipped_count
msgid "Ignored (no negatives)"
msgstr "Ignorados (sin negativos)"

#. module: account_fix_storno_negative
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_fix_storno_negative.field_account_fix_storno_wizard__line_count
msgid ""
"Number of journal item lines with negative debit or credit that will be "
"re-expressed to the standard positive form (positive value in the opposite "
"column)."
msgstr ""
"Número de líneas de apunte con débito o crédito negativo que se reexpresarán "
"a la forma estándar positiva (valor positivo en la columna opuesta)."

#. module: account_fix_storno_negative
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_fix_storno_negative.field_account_fix_storno_wizard__move_count
msgid ""
"Number of selected journal entries that contain at least one line with "
"negative debit or credit and will therefore be corrected."
msgstr ""
"Número de asientos seleccionados que contienen al menos una línea con débito "
"o crédito negativo y que, por tanto, se corregirán."

#. module: account_fix_storno_negative
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_fix_storno_negative.field_account_fix_storno_wizard__move_ids
msgid ""
"Journal entries selected when the fix was launched. Only those with at least "
"one line in negative debit or credit are counted and corrected; the rest are "
"reported as ignored."
msgstr ""
"Asientos contables seleccionados al lanzar la corrección. Solo los que tienen "
"al menos una línea con débito o crédito negativo se cuentan y se corrigen; el "
"resto se informa como ignorado."

#. module: account_fix_storno_negative
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_fix_storno_negative.field_account_fix_storno_wizard__skipped_count
msgid ""
"Number of selected journal entries that have no negative debit or credit "
"line. They are neither counted nor modified."
msgstr ""
"Número de asientos seleccionados que no tienen ninguna línea con débito o "
"crédito negativo. No se cuentan ni se modifican."

#. module: account_fix_storno_negative
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_fix_storno_negative/models/account_move.py:0
msgid "Fix Storno"
msgstr "Corregir storno"

#. module: account_fix_storno_negative
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_fix_storno_negative/models/account_move.py:0
#: model:ir.actions.server,name:account_fix_storno_negative.action_fix_storno_negative
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:account_fix_storno_negative.view_fix_storno_wizard_form
msgid "Fix Storno (negative debit/credit)"
msgstr "Corregir storno (débito/crédito negativos)"

#. module: account_fix_storno_negative
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_fix_storno_negative/models/account_move.py:0
msgid "No lines with negative debit or credit in the selection."
msgstr "No hay líneas con débito o crédito negativo en la selección."

#. module: account_fix_storno_negative
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_fix_storno_negative/models/account_move.py:0
#, python-format
msgid "Fixed %(lines)s lines in %(moves)s journal entries."
msgstr "Se corrigieron %(lines)s líneas en %(moves)s asientos contables."

#. module: account_fix_storno_negative
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:account_fix_storno_negative.view_fix_storno_wizard_form
msgid ""
"The negative values will move to the opposite column in positive. Balance, "
"taxes, reconciliations and the electronic document are not modified, and no "
"entry is reset to draft."
msgstr ""
"Los valores negativos pasarán a la columna opuesta en positivo. El balance, "
"los impuestos, las conciliaciones y el documento electrónico no se modifican, "
"y ningún asiento vuelve a borrador."

#. module: account_fix_storno_negative
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:account_fix_storno_negative.view_fix_storno_wizard_form
msgid ""
"Some selected entries have no negative debit or credit: they are ignored "
"(neither counted nor fixed)."
msgstr ""
"Algunos asientos seleccionados no tienen débito o crédito negativo: se "
"ignoran (ni se cuentan ni se corrigen)."

#. module: account_fix_storno_negative
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:account_fix_storno_negative.view_fix_storno_wizard_form
msgid ""
"None of the selected journal entries has negative debit or credit. There is "
"nothing to fix."
msgstr ""
"Ninguno de los asientos seleccionados tiene débito o crédito negativo. No hay "
"nada que corregir."

#. module: account_fix_storno_negative
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:account_fix_storno_negative.view_fix_storno_wizard_form
msgid "Fix"
msgstr "Corregir"

#. module: account_fix_storno_negative
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:account_fix_storno_negative.view_fix_storno_wizard_form
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Cancelar"
